Ported from esp-sdr (src/sdr_rx.c, src/dsp.c, src/link.cpp):
  - main/targets/esp32/receiver.c   (dump-engine capture, tuning, gain, filter,
                                     ESP32 command set)
  - main/common/rx_lo.h, rx_bandwidth.h (LO planning, analog filter curve)
  - main/common/burst_commands.h, burst_capture.h, burst_parse.h,
    burst_serial.c (protocol 6 command handling, packing, lease)
  - main/common/spectrum.c, spectrum_dc.h, spectrum_math.h, spectrum_stats.c
    (SPEC/SPC1/SPS1 framing, DC tracker, power-code encoding)

web/esp-web-sdr/ holds unmodified esp-web-sdr files (see UPSTREAM.txt); the
build applies the patches listed in tools/build_web.py. web/ws-transport.js
replaces esp-web-sdr's serial-transport.js. The Carlito font inside
fonts.css is under the SIL Open Font License, as noted in that file.

